# 5️⃣ Why Multi-Stage Image is Smaller?

## Single Stage

Contains

- Source Code
- Build Tools
- Dependencies
- Cache
- Temporary Files

Everything remains inside image.

Result

```
Large Image
```

---

## Multi Stage

Stage 1

- Build project

Stage 2

- Copy only required files

Everything else is discarded.

Result

```
Smaller Image
```

