---

## Important

Docker Tag **does NOT copy or rename the image.**

It creates another reference pointing to the same IMAGE ID.

Example

Before

```
day35-multi
```

After

```
day35-multi

anujpratapsingh/day35-multistage:1.0
```

Both point to the same IMAGE ID.

