# 1️⃣1️⃣ Image vs Repository vs Tag

## Image

A packaged application with all required dependencies.

Example

```
day35-multi:latest
```

---

## Repository

A collection of image versions stored on Docker Hub.

Example

```
day35-multistage
```

---

## Tag

Version of an image.

Example

```
1.0

1.1

latest
```

---

Docker Hub Structure

```
Username
   │
Repository
   │
Tags
```

Example

```
anujpratapsingh
        │
day35-multistage
        │
 ├── 1.0
 ├── 1.1
 └── latest
```

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Image Size Comparison

| Image | Size |
|-------|------|
| Single Stage | Large |
| Multi Stage | Smaller |

Reason

Single Stage contains

- Build tools
- Dependencies
- Cache
- Temporary files

Multi Stage copies only required files.

